# Painter's Studio: "You may play them until the end of your next turn." The Mountain and Lightning Bolt it exiles in turn 1 are still
# playable in Bot1's next turn (3), when it plays the Mountain; the Bolt, left alone, can no longer be cast in turn 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Painter's Studio // Defaced Gallery
Island
Island
Island
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
